    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a short narrative visual novel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows the protagonist, who left his hometown for the city years ago due to a misunderstanding. Though he often wished to return, he never found the courage to do so. One day, during a period of disappointment and emotional low, he meets a blue-haired girl. Mysterious and seemingly aware of everything about him, she encourages him to go back. With her support, he finally sets out on a journey home in search of an answer to something missing within himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple story endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light exploration and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emphasis on psychological and emotional themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-driven with a strong focus on story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle and soothing musical atmosphere</p></li></ul>",
